# 16x16 Basic Pixel Art Creator

I have built the requested 16x16 Pixel Art creator dialog right into your Minecraft Mod Maker application!

## Features Added

* **Pixel Art Canvas**: A 16x16 grid utilizing a custom Swing `JPanel` to draw your pixel data in real time with left-click, overriding any grid sector underneath.
* **Color Selection**: Embedded a fully featured `JColorChooser` on the right side so you have a massive variety of colors.
* **Texture Substitution**: A new `"Create"` button next to `"Browse"` allows you to pop open the new dialog, draw whatever you like, and on save, it dynamically outputs a `BufferedImage` into a temporary `PNG` file linking directly into your queue.
* **Non-destructive UI**: You keep the original ability to import any 16x16 standard image file directly via `"Browse"`.

## Verification Details

* The `ModMakerApp.java` component properly spawns instances of the `PixelArtDialog` utilizing the `this` reference as the parent window, retaining modality.
* Changes compiled correctly within the local workspace environment.

> [!TIP]
> The image files are created natively using JVM's `.createTempFile()` ensuring it does not pollute your directory when you close the app.
